# Opened-message (read) window ribbon: Message tab (plan/outlook/read-window.md, responsive.md "Read window").
# Commands get {"ids": [<item>]} / {"id": <item>} added by the ribbon. Help falls back to the main window's.

surface read
mode simplified

tab Message | H | more=moreRead
group Move & Delete | ZA | s1366=nolabel1
split S | Delete | delete | mail.delete | | D | menu=readDeleteMore
button S | Archive... | archive | mail.archive | | O1
drop S | Move | move | | | MV | menu=move s500=overflow
group Respond | ZR | s1280=nolabel
button S | Reply | reply | mail.reply | {"window":true} | RP
button S | Reply All | reply-all | mail.replyAll | {"window":true} | RA
button S | Forward | forward | mail.forward | {"window":true} | FW
group Quick Steps | ZQ | s1600=narrow s1024=overflow
gallery S | Quick Steps | quick-steps | | | QS | dyn=quicksteps menu=quickSteps w=240
group Tags | ZO | s600=overflow
button S | Mark Unread | unread | mail.toggleRead | | U
drop S | Categorize | categorize | | | G | menu=categorize s700=overflow
drop S | Follow Up | flag | | | W | menu=followUp s700=overflow
button S | Message Options... | settings | mail.messageOptions | | OP | s900=overflow
group Editing | ZE | s900=overflow
button S | Find... | search | format.find | | FD
group Immersive | I | s1100=overflow
button S | Read Aloud | conversation | review.readAloud | | R1
group Language | ZL | s1100=overflow
drop S | Translate | email | | | T | menu=translate
group Zoom | ZZ | s1366=overflow
button S | Zoom... | zoom-in | view.zoom | | Q1

mode classic

tab Message | H
group Delete | ZD | c1366=nolabel c700=collapse
toggle S | Ignore | ignore | mail.ignore | | X | on=ignored
drop S | Clean Up | clean-up | | | C | menu=cleanUp
drop S | Junk | junk | | | J | menu=readJunk
button L | Delete | delete | mail.delete | | D
button L | Archive... | archive | mail.archive | | O1
group Respond | ZR | c1366=nolabel c1024=iconly c700=collapse
button L | Reply | reply | mail.reply | {"window":true} | RP
button L | Reply All | reply-all | mail.replyAll | {"window":true} | RA
button L | Forward | forward | mail.forward | {"window":true} | FW
button S | Meeting | meeting | mail.replyWithMeeting | | MR
drop S | More | more | | | ME | menu=respondMore
group Quick Steps | ZQ | c900=collapse launch=quicksteps.manage
gallery L | Quick Steps | quick-steps | | | QS | dyn=quicksteps menu=quickSteps w=210
group Move | ZM | c1024=collapse
drop L | Move | move | | | MV | menu=move
drop S | Rules | rules | | | RR | menu=rules
drop S | Actions | more | | | AC | menu=readActions
group Tags | ZT | c1024=collapse launch=mail.messageOptions
button S | Mark Unread | unread | mail.toggleRead | | U
drop S | Categorize | categorize | | | G | menu=categorize
drop S | Follow Up | flag | | | W | menu=followUp
group Editing | ZE | c900=collapse
button S | Find... | search | format.find | | FD
drop S | Related | conversation | | | RL | menu=readRelated
drop S | Select | check | | | SL | menu=readSelect
group Immersive | ZI | c800=collapse
button L | Read Aloud | conversation | review.readAloud | | R1
group Language | ZL | c800=collapse
drop L | Translate | email | | | T | menu=translate
group Zoom | ZZ | c800=collapse
button L | Zoom... | zoom-in | view.zoom | | Q

menu readDeleteMore
item | Clean Up Conversation | clean-up | mail.cleanUpConversation | | C
item | Clean Up Folder | | mail.cleanUpFolder | | L
item | Clean Up Folder & Subfolders | | mail.cleanUpSubfolders | | E

menu readJunk
item | Block Sender | block | mail.block | {"kind":"sender"} | B
item | Never Block Sender | | mail.block | {"kind":"neverSender"} | S
item | Never Block Sender's Domain | | mail.block | {"kind":"neverDomain"} | D
item | Never Block this Group or Mailing List | | mail.block | {"kind":"neverList"} | M
item | Not Junk | check | mail.junk | {"action":"notJunk"} | N
sep
item | Junk E-mail Options... | junk | mail.junk | {"action":"options"} | O

menu translate
item | Translate Message | email | review.translate | | T
item | Show Original | undo | review.translate | {"showOriginal":true} | S
sep
item | Translation Preferences... | settings | options.open | {"page":"language"} | P

menu readActions
item | Edit Message | draft | mail.editMessage | | E
item | Resend This Message... | send | mail.resend | | S
sep
item | View Source | info | mail.viewSource | | V

menu readRelated
item | Messages in this Conversation | conversation | mail.findRelated | {"kind":"conversation"} | C
item | Messages from Sender | person | mail.findRelated | {"kind":"sender"} | S

menu readSelect
item | Select All | check | format.selectAll | | A
item | Select All Text With Similar Formatting | | format.selectSimilar | | S

menu moreRead
sub | Junk | junk | readJunk | | J
item | Meeting | meeting | mail.replyWithMeeting | | M
sub | Actions | more | readActions | | A
sub | Related | conversation | readRelated | | R
sub | Select | check | readSelect | | S
